   "review_text": "This was the first time we visit the restaurant, we were looking for a place to have a new year dinner and celebrate my daughters birthday , I looked online and saw that they have a special dinner and a band playing , the food looks good in the pictures and they had a good review so we decided to try it. We had an amazing time, the food was delicious!!! We had appetizer soup /salad main chorus and dessert. our waitress was amazing (sorry I forgot her name)!!, the band was great. They let me bring a cake and we celebrate my daughter birthday right after midnight. Highly Highly recommend , thank you again for an amazing night , what a great way to start the year"
